WEBVTT

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:13.220
You can't believe it?

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.550
-You bastard!
-Clive!

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.650
Not so easy!

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:27.610
You got slow, Takanori.

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:30.230
Don't be so cocky, Clive!

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.570
Do you understand now?

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:36.950
I admit it.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.330
You're the real Clive.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:44.210
When someone tells me there's no way
to escape from my information,

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.080
I have to tell them with my actions. Right?

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.250
If that's true,

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.670
what happened in the ocean
must have been real too.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.300
And...

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:59.430
Pleiades? No way.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.770
It's all true.

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:24.870
Seven Senses of the Re'Union

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:37.990
The Chance Meeting of the Stars

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:44.120
Clive. It looks like you know something.

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:46.620
Well... actually...

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:48.330
I don't know much.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:50.120
You don't know?

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:51.790
I was asked to help.

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:53.380
By Elicia.

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:55.630
By Elicia?

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:57.170
Elicia?

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:59.220
Asahi, Satsuki, you saw her too, right?

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:02.680
In that vision Aegir's red stone.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:04.760
That was Elicia.

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:09.390
Elicia and I were watching over you,
protecting you.

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:14.440
Hey, Haruto.

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:17.480
How do you know Elicia?

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:18.820
Yeah, how?

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:21.450
I've just talked to her a few times.

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:23.200
Why didn't you say anything?

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:24.910
Yeah, why?

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.450
She shows up and disappears suddenly.

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:29.910
I didn't know what to tell you.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:32.710
So, what did you talk about?

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:37.170
I bet you won't believe this...

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:40.170
In another world?

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:45.430
When Simon stabbed me,
Asahi unconsciously used the Prophet Art.

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.430
That's what Elicia said.

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:48.850
I did that?

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:52.390
Anyway, unless I see Elicia and speak to her directly,

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:54.360
I won't believe it completely.

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.650
Are you calling me a liar?

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:59.030
Do you have any proof it wasn't just a dream?

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:01.240
Of course I don't have any proof!

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:03.490
Stop it, you two!

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:07.700
Yeah. You guys haven't changed at all.

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:09.620
But...

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:14.330
The most important thing
is that people are after Asahi, right?

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:16.040
You're right.

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:17.590
That part is true.

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:19.960
Why?

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:23.050
You're saying I have the power to choose the future?

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:26.100
I don't understand at all.

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:27.850
Asahi...

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:31.270
Gnosis is trying to awaken Asahi.

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:33.600
In order to stop them,

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:36.980
everyone in Subaru must awaken.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:38.860
That's what Elicia said.

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:40.530
Our awakening?

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:41.990
What does that mean?

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:48.240
There are still many things we don't know
about the potential of the human brain.

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:54.120
Union is a training ground for using the Senses
in the real world.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:55.290
No...

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:58.750
It's a system that was constructed to be a laboratory.

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.050
No way.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:03.130
Everyone in Subaru?

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:05.800
Hey, Takanori.

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:08.970
You said Nozomi came back the other day, right?

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.810
-Yeah.
-Really?

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:13.100
Then we can see Nozomi!

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:15.440
If she logs in...

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:17.350
I'll send you her address.

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.230
Haruto and Satsuki, you go.

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.280
Why is it just us?

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:22.820
Let's all go together.

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:25.490
I'm busy. And...

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:27.660
Nozomi was afraid of me.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.200
What?

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:32.790
She's shy.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:36.580
If I'm there, she might hesitate to log in.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:40.340
She was always nervous when she talked to me.

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:42.590
You're overthinking things.

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:45.130
Oh, dear. You worry too much.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:46.930
I'm being objective.

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:52.180
You guys are all so clueless!

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:53.970
That's so true.

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:00.690
I think it's near here.

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.240
Here it is.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.400
KUSAKA

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:10.950
Are you Haruto and Satsuki?

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:17.000
Nozomi?

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:19.830
I was right! Wow, it's been a while!

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.210
Yeah... Yeah!

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.260
A model?

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:28.760
That's right. I'm an amateur model for a magazine.

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:31.220
Nozomi, you changed a lot.

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:35.350
When I transferred schools, I was alone again.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:39.900
I thought about you guys
and wanted to feel full of energy like that again.

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:42.860
I wanted to get over being shy.

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:46.860
I paid attention to fashion and changed my hairstyle.

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:49.360
I tried really hard,

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:51.700
and I made new friends naturally.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.410
I wanted to break out of my shell.

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:55.620
Your shell?

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:58.290
It must have been hard finding my address.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.500
Takanori looked it up.

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:05.250
Takanori?

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:08.510
We have a favor to ask of you.

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:10.510
Me?

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:14.930
Re'Union?

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.060
It's a renewal of Union.

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:19.180
It's pretty famous.

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:20.600
I didn't know...

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:22.480
We met Clive recently too.

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:25.320
Clive? It's been a long time!

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:28.280
I didn't talk to him much back then.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:30.950
I see. Re'Union...

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:33.820
Hey. Let's all play together again, like we used to.

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:35.200
Sorry.

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:38.290
I don't play games anymore.

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:41.040
All you have to do is log in.

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:43.920
I've been...

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:47.300
keeping my distance from games.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:50.550
Nozomi...

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:55.550
Asahi is still alive in Re'Union.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:01.440
Satsuki, that's not funny.

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:04.400
I know it's hard to believe.

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:07.400
But I want you to just login once. Please!

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:10.280
Haruto...

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:14.320
See you later.

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:16.450
Yeah. I'll contact you again.

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:19.950
I wish I could see Takanori next time too.

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:23.710
I got it. I'll bring him.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:31.510
Just being able to see her today... it was worth it.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:37.220
It feels weird to hear Nozomi say
she's meeting up with a friend.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:41.980
Wow, so this is what Nozomi looks like now.

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:44.100
She changed a lot.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:45.900
How nice.

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:48.020
I really want to see her!

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:52.990
My ID was still active,
so I'm sure Nozomi can still login too.

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:54.990
But she doesn't want to.

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:59.740
She's still the same as she was
six years ago in some ways.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:02.370
What? I didn't notice.

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:04.790
Of course you wouldn't.

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.170
What do you mean by that?

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:10.210
Anyway, you're coming next time too, Takanori.

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:13.300
-But--
-Please, Takanori!

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:16.590
If it means we'll see Nozomi again,
that we'll have Subaru again...

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:18.640
let's do whatever we can!

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:22.640
Well, I'll think about it.

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:23.930
EVENT NOTIFICATION

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:26.400
An event notification? I wonder what it is.

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:29.650
The Sweet Dance Party?

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.900
It's like a prom.

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:34.610
I've seen them in foreign movies!

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:38.160
Guys ask girls to go with them.

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:43.160
On this blessed night,
everlasting love will be born.

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:45.660
-That's what it says.
-Everlasting love?

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:47.370
It's like...

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:49.920
-Love forever.
-Forever...

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:53.170
They have all sorts of events.

00:09:56.970 --> 00:10:01.890
Seven Senses of the Re'Union

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:35.460
Hey, Satsuki.

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:37.720
Sorry! I know this is sudden.

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:40.510
It's almost time anyway.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:43.140
Coming 30 minutes early isn't a big deal.

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:45.180
What did you want to talk to me about?

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:47.270
Well...

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:49.730
Is it about Nozomi?

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:55.280
Oh, yeah. I messaged her to ask
when we can see her next.

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:57.320
So, what did she say?

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:59.700
She hasn't replied yet.

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:03.620
I see. It looks like it's not going to work out.

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:06.700
Haruto...

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:12.210
About tomorrow's dance...

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:14.380
Dance?

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:20.130
Invite me...

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:21.390
What?

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:24.220
I want you to...

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:26.600
invite me...

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:28.600
to go to the dance with you.

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:31.190
What are you saying?

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:34.650
I'm going to get mad if you're just joking!
I'm serious!

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:42.490
On this blessed night,

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:45.120
everlasting love will be born.

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:51.210
I-- Ever since elementary school...

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:53.750
You probably didn't realize it back then
but...

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:57.670
We went to different high schools and...

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:00.550
It took a lot of courage...

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.430
To visit your house.

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:04.640
Well...

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:09.100
You can give me your reply tomorrow.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:25.490
I-- Ever since elementary school...

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:29.490
NEW MESSAGE

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:33.210
Takanori?

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:35.210
COME TO ASAHI'S GRAVE RIGHT NOW!

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:40.210
Those flowers...

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:43.550
I grow them at home.

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:46.140
I brought them because they bloomed.

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:49.140
Asahi liked pink gerberas.

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:51.810
-I saw some here the last time I visited.
-Yeah.

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:54.100
It was the day you stole from her grave.

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:56.060
You were watching?

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:58.190
It's not like I wanted to.

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:02.690
I'm going to invite Asahi to the dance party.

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:06.530
I'm not asking you for permission.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:07.910
But...

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:10.410
I had to tell you.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.000
My honor is on the line.

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:15.210
Do whatever you want.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:18.750
It's that exact attitude I hate!

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:22.380
-I don't know what you're trying to say!
-If you don't understand--

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:25.880
Get out of my world!

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:28.640
What are you doing?

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:31.140
I'll be the one who protects Asahi!

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:32.890
Quit joking around!

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:37.100
I've been thinking about Asahi for six years.

00:13:37.270 --> 00:13:41.400
-Unlike you! You were just lazy!
-You think you can say whatever you want?

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:44.400
I'm the one who should be by Asahi's side!

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:46.360
Not you!

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:48.780
You can't beat me.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:51.200
Not in Re'Union, and not in real life!

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.160
But... Why?

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:55.160
What are you trying to say?

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.920
Why did Asahi appear in front of you?

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:01.920
Why did Asahi protect you six years ago?

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:05.670
Are you trying to say
you wish I was the one who died instead?

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:07.630
I do now!

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:10.180
Then everything would have worked out right!

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:14.980
You might be right.

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:19.100
But I can't agree with you now!

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:25.740
I love Asahi.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:30.910
Ever since elementary school,
her smile always saved me.

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:34.240
When I heard she had appeared again,

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:36.960
I wanted to be the one who saved her this time.

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:39.210
I'm going to protect her smile,

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:41.920
even if I have to sacrifice myself.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:45.010
You don't get it at all.

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:47.260
What is it you think I don't get?

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:49.550
-I--
-Protect her smile?

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:53.510
You think Asahi is always just happy?

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:57.020
She wants to see her parents and go home.

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:59.230
She cries when no one is watching.

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:01.350
But she still believes in us.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:05.730
That's why she's able to keep smiling even if it's hard.

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:11.820
The only thing she wishes for now
is for Subaru to come together again.

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:14.780
If there's even one star missing, it's no good!

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:17.450
You're going to sacrifice yourself?

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:19.080
That's not what Asahi wants.

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:23.590
If you love her, you should act mature enough
to accept me, even if you hate me!

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:25.090
You idiot!

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:26.880
Look who's talking!

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:30.090
I love Asahi too!

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:34.850
So I'm not going to lose to you!

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:39.810
You finally admitted it.

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:44.860
-I quit.
-What?

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:48.820
I just wanted to get you to say what you really think.

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:52.110
Really?

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:56.280
-Haruto.
-What?

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:59.290
I admit that last hit you got in on me was real.

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:02.620
I'll take that as a compliment.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:13.090
I swear on this ring, we'll be together forever!

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:26.360
I can't blame you, Haruto.

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:30.570
I asked your mom to give me this memento of you.

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:34.990
But I... don't need it anymore.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:38.030
Because I'm going to go see you now.

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:55.180
Satsuki. Sorry to make you wait.

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:03.180
-I...
-You don't have to say anything else.

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:06.480
-Sorry...
-You decided, right?

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:09.940
Then you should go now.

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:13.450
Hurry.

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:14.700
Okay.

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:17.320
-I'm really sorry.
-I'll get mad if you annoy me.

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.540
He rejected you, didn't he?

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.340
Why are you here?

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:34.840
I thought you went to see Asahi.

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:36.970
Do you really mean that?

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:39.180
Or are you just being mean?

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:43.430
She told me clearly
that she can't dance with me.

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:46.520
But you don't seem that sad about it.

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:50.360
I thought you would be more depressed.

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:52.730
I just got a better view of reality.

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:56.820
I need to broaden my perspective.

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:58.990
It's natural she rejected me.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:05.960
We haven't grown up at all.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:09.790
Yeah. We're the same as we used to be.

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:16.880
You don't want to be alone, right?

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:21.140
All right. I don't want your eternal love though.

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:23.850
You don't have to be so blunt.

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:38.660
Where is she?

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:47.790
Asahi...

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:49.170
Yeah?

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:52.420
Will you...

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:55.050
dance with me?

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:59.630
You're fine with dancing with me?

00:19:00.220 --> 00:19:02.510
It has to be you.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:04.560
Okay!

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:09.270
Let's dance in the middle. It'll be fun!

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:12.060
I'll do whatever you want today.

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:15.070
Yeah... Thanks for being my escort.

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:17.490
Yeah.

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:23.580
Takanori wanted to see you too.

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:27.790
-Let's go!
-Wait!

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:34.540
Kusaka!

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:38.670
Mikado...

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:40.800
Why are you cleaning by yourself?

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:44.600
Everyone said they had something to do.

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:46.100
Everyone?

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:49.430
This always happens.

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:55.610
Do you want to clean by yourself?

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:58.990
Don't worry about it.

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:00.490
But...

00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:02.610
When it's my turn to clean,

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:05.070
I'll make those slackers clean instead.

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:08.750
Sorry.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:09.750
No.

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:13.370
You should say thanks.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:15.380
You don't have to apologize to me.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:20.260
-Thanks.
-Takanori!

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:24.010
You said you came to get something.
Why are you cleaning?

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:26.390
Kusaka, you're alone?

00:20:26.550 --> 00:20:27.760
Where is everyone else?

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:29.020
They skipped out.

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:30.890
That's terrible.

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:32.440
We have to tell the teacher.

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:34.520
We'll help you too.

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:35.770
Yeah.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:38.650
Hey. When we're done, come play with us.

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:40.440
Yes.

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:42.150
Hey. Let's hurry!

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:44.110
Stop acting like you're the leader!

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:45.370
Who are you talking to?

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:48.530
Hey! I don't care if you fight. Just don't stop cleaning!

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:50.790
Let's get this done fast.

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:53.460
Yeah. Sorry...

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:57.250
-I'm not trying to act cool!
-It's your fault! You're so slow!

00:20:57.420 --> 00:20:58.340
Thanks...

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:00.420
-Not true!
-Let's see who finishes first!

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:21.940
I wonder if they're all here.

00:21:22.360 --> 00:21:25.950
I should have told Satsuki I was coming.

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:30.450
Takanori.

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:34.960
Satsuki...

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:36.460
Why...?

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:49.640
I'm so stupid.

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:53.470
I... shouldn't have come.

00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:58.690
Where am I?

00:22:02.570 --> 00:22:03.610
Who's there?

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:11.870
Welcome, Nozomi Kusaka.

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:16.160
Gnosis welcomes you.

00:23:56.890 --> 00:23:58.720
Um...so...

00:23:58.890 --> 00:24:00.390
Don't worry about it!

00:24:00.560 --> 00:24:02.810
I know what you're trying to say.

00:24:02.980 --> 00:24:05.520
Episode 10, "The Girl who Disappeared."

00:24:05.690 --> 00:24:09.780
We have another idiot in Subaru!
